Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 让我们齐心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:28.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on now, let's get together in perfect harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我有20英亩 你有43英亩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:34.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got 20 acres and you've got 43...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:41.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:44.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是我的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:52.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And there is my quest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}清走卡莱布那些浸水的干草垛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:56.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}clearing away Kaleb's soggy hay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}给我起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:04.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Up you come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:09.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:10.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:14.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}For fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:27.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:28.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我正在纳闷 我们怎么会有五袋喂野鸟的鸟粮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:33.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. I was just wondering why we've got five bags of wild bird seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}额
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah! Erm--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}按照乡村管理计划 我们要做一些补充性投喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:40.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got to do some supplementary feeding under the Countryside Stewardship Scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 什么 喂那些鸟 喂鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:43.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So... What? Feeding the birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:44.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}放在什么东西里投喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:48.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What do I put it into to make it bird feed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:49.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}按照规定 我们要把它洒在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:53.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}喂 能听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:56.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, can you hear me? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:57.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}今天剩下的时间 我还要打扫牛圈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:06.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, the rest of the day, I've got to muck out the cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后又是捡鸡蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:10.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and in a little bit time, I've got to collect more eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}喂山羊 再喂一次猪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:14.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And feed the goats, and feed the pigs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:16.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:21.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}猜猜明天我要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:21.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Guess what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我要喂猪 喂山羊 捡鸡蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:24.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna feed the pigs, feed the goats, collect the eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}除了饲养各种动物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:28.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And on top of all the animal husbandry,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在又到了一年中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we were now getting to that time of year
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}需要开始考虑种庄稼的日子了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:34.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}when I'd have to start thinking about planting the crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是冬小麦 对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:36.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is winter wheat. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}需要栽种硬粒小麦 对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:38.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The durum wheat needs doing. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}春季大麦 也需要栽种
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:40.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Spring barley, that needs doing. Spring barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}需要考虑的不只是小麦和大麦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:44.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it wasn't just the wheat and barley that needed sorting,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为政府刚刚公布了 一大堆振奋人心的新计划
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:48.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because the government had just announced all the exciting new schemes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}用于取代之前的欧盟补贴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:52.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that would replace the old EU subsidies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如同查理解释的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:54.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And as Charlie explained,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我得种植新的作物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}this meant I'd have to plant new crops
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一堆让人眼花缭乱 不明所以的新名词
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:01.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}whose names were a blizzard of Whitehall gobbledygook.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}农场商店周围的这些地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:05.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This, which is all the land around the farm shop...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:06.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是"草本牧地SAM3"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:09.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is Herbal Ley SAM3.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}听着像是导弹的名字 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:11.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Which sounds like a missile. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么是草本牧地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:13.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's a herbal ley?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}草本牧地就是GS4 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:16.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A herbal ley is a GS4. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}草本牧地就是GS4
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:18.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Herbal ley is GS4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可持续农业激励计划 就是这个SFI
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:21.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The sustainable farming incentive. That's the SFI.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 其中涵盖了GS4
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. That covers the GS4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}其中涵盖了 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That covers... No. That...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可持续农业激励计划 为草本牧地取了个代号 叫做SAM3
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:30.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The SFI has a code of SAM3 for the herbal ley,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是乡村管理计划 这是另一个计划
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:34.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but Countryside Stewardship, which is another scheme...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也就是"CSSHT" 对 这个高层级计划涵盖了这块地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:39.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's CSS HT. Yes, the higher tier, which covers this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我要种植
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:41.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So... But I'm planting...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这块地叫做SAM3 同时又叫GS4
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:43.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a SAM3, but it's also a GS4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也叫草本牧地 就叫草本牧地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:46.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's a herbal ley.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}乡村事务部
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:47.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It is a herbal ley.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是开了多少次会议 才想出这个名字的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:51.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How many fucking meetings have Defra had to come up with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}重点是 只要我不种庄稼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:54.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The bottom line was that the government would give me money
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只种能让土壤更健康的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so long as I didn't grow food,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}政府就会给我钱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:01.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}only stuff that would make the soil healthier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}草本牧地由三种关键植物构成
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:05.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, herbal ley is a mix of three kinda key different species.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:08.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}牧草 草本植物和一些豆类
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:08.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got grasses, herbs and some legumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}其原理是 这些植物的根系深度不同
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:11.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The point is, they all root at different depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}能够创造不同类型的土壤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:13.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They create a different sort of soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一种土壤措施 所以叫做SAM 能让土壤变得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:16.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is "soil action", hence SAM. It makes the soil better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 在土壤上投入
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:18.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Invest in the soil,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}让土地暂停轮耕几年
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:21.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}take it out of the rotation for a couple of years...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 你还可以在上面放牧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:24.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. And then you can also graze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我正想问 我们可以在上面放羊和放牛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:26.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was about to say, we can put sheep and cows on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以 所以牲畜有免费的饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. So they get free food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 政府保证每英亩补贴160英镑 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:34.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. And the government guarantees £160 an acre. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有别的好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:35.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And there was more good news,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}政府还提高了对于我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:39.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because the government had also upped the amount they were paying me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}照料野花草场的补贴金额
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:42.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to look after my wildflower meadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以前政府给我们一百英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:46.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So they were giving us £100.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每英亩将近一百英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:48.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Pretty much. Just under £100 an acre, and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是每英亩240英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:50.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you're gonna get £240 an acre.
