Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.08,0:31:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很高兴能请到她 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.08,0:31:22.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm bloody glad we've got her. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.88,0:31:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对了 你知道什么是TikTok吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.88,0:31:25.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Also, do you know what TikTok is?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.52,0:31:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 TikTok 我听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.52,0:31:27.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? TikTok? I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.92,0:31:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}她 她是TikTok博主
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.92,0:31:31.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is she... She's a TikToker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.44,0:31:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.44,0:31:35.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.40,0:31:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天 你看 她已经开始直播了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.40,0:31:41.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh God, she's already been TikToking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.76,0:31:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.76,0:31:43.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's you! You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.76,0:31:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是迪丽斯库阿特 所以她已经 对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.76,0:31:46.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's Diddly Squat, so she's already... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:49.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我搞不太懂TikTok
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't really understand TikTok.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.40,0:32:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来的几天
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.40,0:32:20.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Over the next few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.24,0:32:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}爱玩TikTok的哈莉特工作很勤奋
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.24,0:32:24.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}TikTok Harriet worked like a Trojan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.92,0:32:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.92,0:32:26.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.68,0:32:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我讨厌未经修剪的树篱 看起来一点都不整齐
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.68,0:32:47.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I hate it when hedges haven't been cut, 'cause they never look neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.44,0:32:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}她在修剪树篱的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.44,0:32:50.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And while she was trimming the hedges,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.08,0:32:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}遇见了 迪丽斯库阿特大家庭的另一位成员
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.08,0:32:55.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}she got to meet another member of the Diddly Squat family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.36,0:32:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.36,0:32:59.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hiya. Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.08,0:33:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我是哈莉特 很高兴认识你 哈莉特
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.08,0:33:01.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Harriet. Nice to meet you, Harriet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.92,0:33:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.92,0:33:03.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.32,0:33:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他说他可以在那上面再弄一个 要是他想的话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.32,0:33:05.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He said he could get another one on the top of there if he wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.12,0:33:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这拖拉机速度太快了 不够慢 无法修剪树篱
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.12,0:33:09.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's too fast. The tractor doesn't go slow enough for me to cut hedges.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.52,0:33:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}需要提高一档
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.52,0:33:10.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it wants a higher gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.12,0:33:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我是说修剪那个侧面 顶部修低一点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.12,0:33:15.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I was saying do the sides right, bear down tight on top on there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.84,0:33:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}窄一点 还有这些
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.84,0:33:18.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}just be narrow when going over these ones as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.80,0:33:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你得保持专业
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.04,0:33:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}绝对没可能 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.04,0:33:24.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no chance in the world, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.36,0:33:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.36,0:33:25.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.60,0:33:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.60,0:33:26.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.52,0:33:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.52,0:33:33.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.64,0:33:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在哈莉特包揽了所有常规工作
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.64,0:33:38.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With Harriet now doing all the usual jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.24,0:33:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以及几项我们甚至没想到的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.24,0:33:43.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and a few we hadn't even thought of...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.68,0:33:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}再跑几趟 院子就干净了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.68,0:33:47.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A few more rows and we'll have a clean yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.00,0:33:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把我从辛苦的日常农活中 解脱了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.00,0:33:54.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was made redundant from the grind of day-to-day farming duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.72,0:34:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我可以专注于解决 农场商店顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.72,0:34:03.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This meant I had the brain space to address the problem of overcrowding
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.48,0:34:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}爆满的问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.48,0:34:06.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}at the farm shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.24,0:34:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.24,0:34:08.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.80,0:34:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}商店生意太火爆了 让政务委员会和当地居民不堪其扰
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.80,0:34:12.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Its popularity continued to annoy both the council and the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.20,0:34:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我需要一样东西 将部分顾客吸引到别处
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.20,0:34:17.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I needed something that would tempt some of the customers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.76,0:34:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我开动脑筋 开始考虑这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.76,0:34:29.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With my thinking cap on, I noodled away at the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.20,0:34:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最终 我想到了一个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.20,0:34:43.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And eventually, I had a eureka moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.80,0:34:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}于是我打电话约查理见面
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.80,0:34:47.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I called Charlie in for one of those meetings
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.88,0:34:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开场白是那句让他心惊胆战的话
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.88,0:34:52.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which began with the words he'd come to dread.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.08,0:34:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想到一个绝妙的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.08,0:34:56.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've had a brilliant idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.12,0:35:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我打算买一个酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.12,0:35:00.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Gonna buy a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.16,0:35:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这就像 你要买一个酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.16,0:35:05.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it's- Like a- You're gonna buy a pub?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.64,0:35:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.64,0:35:06.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.88,0:35:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可是 不 听我说完
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.88,0:35:09.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But... Hear me out, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.64,0:35:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直在考虑 我不想买村子里的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.64,0:35:12.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've been thinking. I don't want to buy a village pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.36,0:35:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.36,0:35:13.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.32,0:35:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为看看 我是说 农场商店离村子那么远
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.32,0:35:16.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because the farm shop is nowhere near a village
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.64,0:35:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}村民还因为人流量太大而抓狂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.64,0:35:19.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and the village went berserk because of the traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.04,0:35:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.04,0:35:21.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't want to have that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.12,0:35:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不想和更多村民发生矛盾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.12,0:35:24.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't want to fall out with any more villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.48,0:35:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}闹市区的酒吧 没有我想要的农场氛围
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.48,0:35:28.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Town centre pub? Not really the farm vibe I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.60,0:35:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}主干道边上的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.60,0:35:31.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Main road pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可是 马车驿站
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:33.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But... Coaching inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.84,0:35:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那个
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.84,0:35:36.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.60,0:35:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后可以把迪丽斯库阿特的农产品
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.60,0:35:39.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Then we can take all the produce from Diddly Squat...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.40,0:35:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 拿到酒吧出售
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.40,0:35:41.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. And sell it all in a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.80,0:35:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.80,0:35:42.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Which...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.84,0:35:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}该怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.84,0:35:45.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How do I phrase this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.60,0:35:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"好主意 杰里米 干得漂亮"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.60,0:35:47.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Brilliant idea, Jeremy. Well done."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.40,0:35:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}差不多吧 我明白你的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.40,0:35:51.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Almost. I get the theory. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.24,0:35:54.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从理论上说 这个主意非常不错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.24,0:35:54.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause in theory, it sounds like a really good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 但是现实是另一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:57.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. But the reality is very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.52,0:36:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道2000年以来 有多少家酒吧倒闭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.52,0:36:00.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how many pubs have closed since 2000?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.20,0:36:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道 三分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.20,0:36:02.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No. A third of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.68,0:36:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}两万家酒吧倒闭
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.68,0:36:04.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}20,000 pubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.44,0:36:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}2000年以来 2000年以来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.44,0:36:07.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Since 2000? Since 2000.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.64,0:36:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那 两万 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.64,0:36:09.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is... 20,000? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.00,0:36:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每年倒闭一千家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.00,0:36:11.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a thousand a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.36,0:36:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}由此可以看出 这一行有多不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.36,0:36:15.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, you can see how tough it is as a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.40,0:36:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这一带仍在营业的酒吧 都是些
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.40,0:36:18.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The only pubs around here that seem to be opening are the ones
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.76,0:36:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老实说 没人消费得起的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.76,0:36:20.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}where, frankly, nobody can afford to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.32,0:36:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个我已经想好了 我不会那样做 我会提供廉价餐饮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.32,0:36:25.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got a plan, I'm not gonna do that. I'm going to make affordable food.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.20,0:36:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你上哪儿招人 人手是个大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.20,0:36:27.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you going to staff it? Staffing's a massive problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}人有的是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:29.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, plenty of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.96,0:36:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}既然这么多酒吧倒闭 想想看 有多少人失业
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.96,0:36:33.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If all the pubs are closing, think of how many people are out of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.16,0:36:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是你要招更多的HR
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.16,0:36:35.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But you're going to sign up to more HR.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.88,0:36:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}HR是什么 人力资源管理人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.88,0:36:37.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's HR? Human resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.20,0:36:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我没有那个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.20,0:36:39.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I don't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.52,0:36:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}必须要有 你要管理那么多员工
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.52,0:36:41.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You need to, to manage all those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.80,0:36:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我在《罗瑟勒姆广告报》上班的时候 报社就没有HR
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.80,0:36:43.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We didn't have HR when I was on the Rotherham Advertiser,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.92,0:36:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我最后一次为别人打工
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.92,0:36:45.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which was the last time I was employed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.84,0:36:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会说 "杰里米 我遇到一个问题"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.84,0:36:48.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So you're gonna have to... "Aw, Jeremy, I've got a problem with..."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.72,0:36:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我会让他们振作精神
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.72,0:36:50.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll tell them to pull themselves together!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.32,0:36:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 能有多难
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.32,0:36:53.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't- How hard can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.92,0:36:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你想想 我们现在有很多头猪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.92,0:36:57.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you think about it, we've got a great many pigs, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.72,0:37:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我们很擅长养鸡产蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.72,0:37:00.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. We're really good on hens and eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.16,0:37:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}常规食物我们都有 面包 意大利面 要什么有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.16,0:37:05.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got all the usual: bread, pasta, we've got all of the things we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.32,0:37:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想不出有什么理由不去做
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.32,0:37:10.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I cannot think of a single reason to not do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.68,0:37:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}直接从农场到餐桌 这正是大家都想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.68,0:37:14.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's farm to fork, it's exactly what everyone wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.60,0:37:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}英国农业能否 通过拯救英国酒吧而拯救自己
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.60,0:37:20.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can British farming save itself by saving the British pub?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.12,0:37:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.12,0:37:22.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.72,0:37:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等着瞧吧 这个地方会让你大开眼界的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.72,0:37:30.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You wait till you see this place. It'll blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.72,0:37:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天 臭死了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.72,0:37:34.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, man! It stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.24,0:37:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 千万别动
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.24,0:37:36.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, stand very still.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.36,0:37:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这算是男人体毛修剪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.36,0:37:38.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is this manscaping?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.60,0:37:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.60,0:37:40.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.44,0:37:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以接着干农活了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.44,0:37:42.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can we just get back to farming?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译 刘波
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.20,0:38:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 张珺怡
